<item><title>White Nile launches sorghum harvest as yields top 17 sacks per feddan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-launches-sorghum-harvest-as-yields-top-17-sacks-d3b956/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/white-nile-launches-sorghum-harvest-as-yields-top-17-sacks-d3b956/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>A Radio Tamazuj survey found sorghum selling for up to SDG 1.05 million a sack in Rabak on 16 November.</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 08:47:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Polish-Sudanese mission uncovers floor of medieval cathedral in Old Dongola</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/polish-sudanese-mission-uncovers-floor-of-medieval-861267/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/polish-sudanese-mission-uncovers-floor-of-medieval-861267/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The team is excavating the Great Church of Jesus, believed to be the largest cathedral in medieval Nubia, with walls reaching 36 feet.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:31:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Sudan court orders Hemedti and 13 others to repay $396.2 million</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-court-orders-hemedti-and-13-others-to-repay-396-2-b05039/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-court-orders-hemedti-and-13-others-to-repay-396-2-b05039/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>The Port Sudan court sentenced them to death in absentia over the looting of the state medical supplies fund and recommended stripping their citizenship.</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:05:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-court-orders-hemedti-and-13-others-to-repay-396-2-b05039/share.jpg" length="42803" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-court-orders-hemedti-and-13-others-to-repay-396-2-b05039/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
